    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to present this traditional two-bedroom cottage located in the peaceful rural setting of Crickamore, just a short drive from Dungloe town.\n\nOffering plenty of character, the property provides a compact and comfortable layout and represents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a permanent residence, holiday retreat or renovation project.\n\nInternally, the accommodation comprises a large central Living Room, Kitchen, two Bedrooms, together with a Back Hall providing access to the rear of the property and a Bathroom.\n\nExternally, the cottage enjoys a pleasant rural setting with outdoor space surrounding the property, together with a small storage shed to the rear providing useful additional space. \n\nIts location at Crickamore provides convenient access to Dungloe and the many beaches, villages and amenities of the surrounding Rosses area.\n\nThe property is in need of restoration and refurbishment works throughout, presenting an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to restore and upgrade the cottage to their own taste and requirements while retaining its traditional character.\n\nImportantly, the property is eligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, offering prospective purchasers the opportunity to avail of financial support towards the cost of bringing the property back into use, subject to the relevant grant terms and conditions.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended and is by STRICT appointment with Campbells Auctioneers\n\nOur Ref: K1296\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room - 5.04m (16'6\") x 4.25m (13'11\")\nTiled Floor, Open Fireplace\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.56m (11'8\") x 2.45m (8'0\")\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.04m (16'6\") x 2.96m (9'9\")\nCarpeted, Fireplace\n\nKitchen - 3.56m (11'8\") x 2.58m (8'6\")\nTiled, Fitted Units\n\nBack Hall - 1.71m (5'7\") x 1m (3'3\")\nTiled, Back door Entrance\n\nBathroom - 2.33m (7'8\") x 1.93m (6'4\")\nTiled Floor & Shower, Electric Shower, Toilet, Hand Basin\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
